# Firebase client config. Not a credential in the usual sense -- the key inside it ships in
# every APK and access is governed by the Firestore rules, not by keeping it quiet. Kept out
# anyway because this repository is public and the project's own rule is that nothing of the
# sort is committed: a stranger holding it can at least burn the free tier's auth quota.
# Download it again from console.firebase.google.com -> project settings -> your apps.
android/app/google-services.json
